Thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:15:26.526 --> 00:15:28.888
"Your One Word", and sharing the post

00:15:28.888 --> 00:15:30.683
that I made on Twitter about it.

00:15:30.683 --> 00:15:32.281
I really appreciate the support,

00:15:32.281 --> 00:15:33.895
and I hope you enjoy the read.

00:15:33.895 --> 00:15:35.380
Thank you guys so much for watching.

