00:15:50.476 --> 00:15:52.727
- In describing your values, you prefer

00:15:52.727 --> 00:15:55.557
to use verbs over nouns.

00:15:55.557 --> 00:15:56.930
Now, why is this the case?

00:15:56.930 --> 00:16:01.254
And, what verbs do you
use to describe yourself?

00:16:01.254 --> 00:16:03.876
- So, values have to be verbs.

00:16:03.876 --> 00:16:05.336
It's not that I like them to be verbs,

00:16:05.336 --> 00:16:06.470
it's that they have to be verbs,

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:09.390
and the reason is because
values are things you do.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:12.744
Values are things you live
by, and you can't do nouns.

00:16:12.744 --> 00:16:14.066
You can only do verbs.

00:16:14.066 --> 00:16:16.918
And so, if you look at an
organization, for example,

00:16:16.918 --> 00:16:19.829
you see companies that
have their corporate values

00:16:19.829 --> 00:16:22.477
on the wall, and it says innovation,

00:16:22.477 --> 00:16:25.288
respect, honesty, right?
(laughing)

00:16:25.288 --> 00:16:26.902
- [Interviewer] Some
nice posters there too,

00:16:26.902 --> 00:16:28.312
I'm sure.
- Yeah, beautiful posters.

00:16:28.312 --> 00:16:29.711
And if you have to write
honesty on the wall,

00:16:29.711 --> 00:16:31.842
you've got bigger problems, you know?

00:16:31.842 --> 00:16:33.617
But you can't do innovation.

00:16:33.617 --> 00:16:35.128
You can't walk into
someone's office and say,

00:16:35.128 --> 00:16:37.203
from now on, please, a
little more innovation

00:16:37.203 --> 00:16:38.702
in all that you do.

00:16:38.702 --> 00:16:41.409
But you can say, look at the world

00:16:41.409 --> 00:16:44.548
from a different perspective,
instead of innovation.

00:16:44.548 --> 00:16:48.376
Instead of honesty, you
can say do the right thing.

00:16:48.376 --> 00:16:50.003
You can hold people accountable to that.

00:16:50.003 --> 00:16:51.675
You can create measurements around that.

00:16:51.675 --> 00:16:54.663
And when somebody says,
you know, were you honest?

00:16:54.663 --> 00:16:56.315
You're like, well yeah, but you know,

00:16:56.315 --> 00:16:57.561
it was more profitable.

00:16:57.561 --> 00:16:58.940
You know, you can sort of
sneak around it, whereas

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.011
if somebody says did
you do the right thing?

00:17:01.011 --> 00:17:02.360
It's a higher standard.

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.904
And so, you have to have
verbs if you want to do them.

00:17:04.904 --> 00:17:08.595
So, my values are take an
unconventional perspective,

00:17:08.595 --> 00:17:11.607
keep it simple, share,

00:17:11.607 --> 00:17:13.636
I believe in sharing
everything, sharing ideas,

00:17:13.636 --> 00:17:16.067
sharing experiences, silver line it, and

00:17:16.067 --> 00:17:18.290
what I mean by that is
I find a silver lining

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:19.201
in every cloud.

00:17:19.201 --> 00:17:20.903
The goal is not to try and fix
the things that are broken,

00:17:20.903 --> 00:17:23.398
the goal is to try and
amplify the things that work.

00:17:23.398 --> 00:17:25.363
And ultimately, one of the goals

00:17:25.363 --> 00:17:27.253
is make long-term progress.

00:17:27.253 --> 00:17:29.680
And because that is a
stated value, a stated

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.114
way of operating,

00:17:31.114 --> 00:17:34.099
and it is a verb, I focus on measuring

00:17:34.099 --> 00:17:36.945
the long-term value that
I can create in the world,

00:17:36.945 --> 00:17:38.823
and not just the short-term gains.

00:17:38.823 --> 00:17:41.279
- First, you sit or lie in a quiet place

00:17:41.279 --> 00:17:44.859
where you can be completely
alone in the silence.

00:17:44.859 --> 00:17:47.289
Through positive affirmations,

00:17:47.289 --> 00:17:49.328
imagine yourself going through

00:17:49.328 --> 00:17:52.076
an important upcoming experience,

00:17:52.076 --> 00:17:54.633
such as a meeting, a presentation,

00:17:54.633 --> 00:17:56.811
a negotiation, or even a date,

00:17:56.811 --> 00:17:59.358
that would improve your work-life balance

00:17:59.358 --> 00:18:01.500
and your quality of life.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.457
As you sit or lie completely relaxed,

00:18:04.457 --> 00:18:07.058
create a picture of the coming event

00:18:07.058 --> 00:18:11.166
and see it unfolding
perfectly in every respect.

00:18:11.166 --> 00:18:14.986
See yourself as calm, positive, happy,

00:18:14.986 --> 00:18:16.779
and in complete control.

00:18:16.779 --> 00:18:19.609
See the other people doing and saying

00:18:19.609 --> 00:18:21.168
exactly what you would want them

00:18:21.168 --> 00:18:24.085
to do if the situation was perfect.

